---
/**
 * A human beat between the proof and the ask. Copy is drawn from real content
 * on /about-me so the teaser doesn't promise something that page won't deliver,
 * and reuses that page's own "Outside the terminal" phrasing so the link reads
 * as continuous.
 */
---

<section data-reveal class="page-section pt-0">
  <div
    class="surface-strong flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-[1.75rem] p-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:p-8"
  >
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="section-label">Off the clock</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-muted sm:text-base">
        There is a person behind the systems — a father, a foodie who orders the strangest thing on
        the menu, and someone slowly building a hydroponic farm at home.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a
      href="/about-me"
      data-transition
      class="button-secondary shrink-0 px-5 py-3 text-sm"
    >
      Step outside the terminal →
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
